# Positioning Source

Positioning is a mental model defined as a conceptual tool for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. It functions as a mental shortcut for making sense of patterns and relationships in the world.

Cross-referenced with Sun Tzu's The Art of War as a universal framework applicable across domains.